  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decent &amp; loc Gov in Korca</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Lokal f&#xf6;rvaltutv i Korca</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med insats &#xe4;r att motverka effekter av strukturomvandling inom ramen f&#xf6;r Albaniens Nationella Strategi f&#xf6;r Decentralisering. &#xd6;vergripande fattigdomsreducering genom st&#xe4;rkande av f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga till f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjning samt tillg&#xe5;ng till h&#xe4;lsoservice, utbildning,  infrastruktur etc.Omedelbar m&#xe5;lgrupp finns framf&#xf6;rallt i Korca men projektaktiviteter kommer &#xe4;ven att inkludera central f&#xf6;rvaltning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to contribute, within the Albanian  Government Strategy for Decentralisation, to the overall ambition of poverty alleviation by by means of enhancing sustainable livelihoods as well as adequate health services, education, infrastructure etc. The immediate target groups are to be found primarily in the Korca region but the activitis will also include the central level.</narrative>
  </description>
